    "domains": "ASCII-insensitive exact/suffix/prefix/universe precedence and longest match; edge wildcard consumes non-empty text; invalid/multiple wildcard rejected",
    "ownership": "arena-owned immutable programs and allocating/reusable per-caller workspace; successful and failing allocator paths tested",
    "limits": "typed RDS, selector publication, capture/substitution and full LDS/RDS/CDS orchestration remain open"
